m it belongs to the parent.\n\n**Checked, no ticket numbers:** Moss digests 2025-03-10, 2025-07-07, 2025-12-01, 2026-05-03, 2026-08-03, and both cheat sheets. Those mention Vantorre Group issues (Mateo's gate delay email, the Hartford Sev 1, the duplicate door-14 entries) without a ticket number.\n\n**Limitation:** I can't open the ticket records themselves. The share listing didn't return a Vantorre Group tickets folder, so everything above comes from channel posts and digests."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
